SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdsb7j9tmWAxUvSfUHHeFkIbsQ3YcHCGEoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjdsb7j9tmWAxUvSfUHHeFkIbsQ3IcHCGAoDw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平日午餐完全不用等，今天點淡麗的版本，不會太鹹，但魚干的醋瓶會不小心加太多，就變成基礎版本？\n湯頭介於鹽味跟醬油之間，多了一點干貨特有味道，麵條也是吃得出麵香，不錯！下次想試試看的乾的。\n溏心蛋的蛋黃走一個尷尬的路線，但有泡過酒還是什麼，蠻好吃的。\n最可惜的是叉燒肉，對我來說就是一片原味的肉片，非常普通，然後有些地方還有一點柴。\n\n一碗不到200元，有肉有蛋，總體還是可以的。（如果水杯可以把免洗透明塑膠杯換掉會更好🤣)",null,[0,124]]]],[null,1781410371000000,1781410371000000,"2 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfc2RrbmZwTFB5b3JpalBQRndVeUFtdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfc2RrbmZwTFB5b3JpalBQRndVeUFtdxoTQ2d3SXc5UzQwUVlRcV9xNS13SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjdsb7j9tmWAxUvSfUHHeFkIbsQ_2MIYigQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxTTFoNlJsaFpWVTVTVlcwNVVHTkVaRkZpTTFwSFQxWmtUVlpY